    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WHOLE BUNCH OF ANIMAL MALARKEY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Arkee Malarkey</i> is a 3D merging puzzle game where you throw animals onto the Ark and merge them into new ones, all while trying to keep the Ark balanced! Explore Classic Mode, tackle challenges in the Arkee Trials, or go against the clock in Score Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/a34f32a0136950f7e586b97645fd9b89.poster.avif?t=1752624355\" aria-label=\"Classic Mode Gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/a34f32a0136950f7e586b97645fd9b89.webm?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/a34f32a0136950f7e586b97645fd9b89.mp4?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASSIC MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss animals onto the Ark and keep it balanced to stay in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/d78e883ac90bbc2dc24f62d11bdd409e.poster.avif?t=1752624355\" aria-label=\"Arkee Trials Gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/d78e883ac90bbc2dc24f62d11bdd409e.webm?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/d78e883ac90bbc2dc24f62d11bdd409e.mp4?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ARKEE TRIALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various levels and challenges by merging golden animals  and unlock new rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/0c738af956e3926586d9380a256d047f.poster.avif?t=1752624355\" aria-label=\"Score Attack GIf\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/0c738af956e3926586d9380a256d047f.webm?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/0c738af956e3926586d9380a256d047f.mp4?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCORE ATTACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go against the clock, earn bonus time and points, and rack up the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WHOLE BUNCH OF ANIMAL MALARKEY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Arkee Malarkey</i> is a 3D merging puzzle game where you throw animals onto the Ark and merge them into new ones, all while trying to keep the Ark balanced! Explore Classic Mode, tackle challenges in the Arkee Trials, or go against the clock in Score Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/a34f32a0136950f7e586b97645fd9b89.poster.avif?t=1752624355\" aria-label=\"Classic Mode Gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/a34f32a0136950f7e586b97645fd9b89.webm?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/a34f32a0136950f7e586b97645fd9b89.mp4?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASSIC MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss animals onto the Ark and keep it balanced to stay in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/d78e883ac90bbc2dc24f62d11bdd409e.poster.avif?t=1752624355\" aria-label=\"Arkee Trials Gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/d78e883ac90bbc2dc24f62d11bdd409e.webm?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/d78e883ac90bbc2dc24f62d11bdd409e.mp4?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ARKEE TRIALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various levels and challenges by merging golden animals  and unlock new rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/0c738af956e3926586d9380a256d047f.poster.avif?t=1752624355\" aria-label=\"Score Attack GIf\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/0c738af956e3926586d9380a256d047f.webm?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478620/extras/0c738af956e3926586d9380a256d047f.mp4?t=1752624355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCORE ATTACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go against the clock, earn bonus time and points, and rack up the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
